Maintainer: Lemonnidos <valentine.pipetkin@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/Lemonnidos/csv2json
Description: CSV to JSON converter
 Converts CSV files with a header row to JSON.
 The field delimiter can be chosen with the -d option
 or in the /etc/csv2json/csv2json.conf file.
